  "description": "The PUBLIC M7 Mixte is our iconic, French-inspired mid-step design—timeless, versatile, and effortlessly stylish.\nIts mid-step frame makes mounting and dismounting easy and graceful. A proven, gender-neutral design widely used throughout Europe, it offers the perfect balance of comfort and sporty performance in an upright riding position.\nIdeal for daily rides, commuting, or weekend exploring, the M7 features a carefully crafted, handmade steel frame that is both durable and lightweight. A coordinating chainguard and full fenders help keep you clean and dry in all conditions.\nDual-pivot brakes with quick release provide confident stopping power, while front and rear rack mounts accommodate a variety of baskets and cargo racks—so you can let the bike handle the carrying.\nWith its classic French aesthetic and thoughtful styling details, the M7 delivers exceptional quality at an accessible price.",
